# Accepted vulnerability exceptions for the release image scan (make scan-images).
# This file is the single list of accepted CVEs; docs/conformance/EXCEPTIONS.md only
# summarises the policy. Format: one ID per line, with a comment above each group:
#   package installed-version -> fixed-version (affected images): reason
# Each entry stops being ignored after its exp: date, and the release scan fails again.
# To accept a new finding, add it here with a comment, an owner and an exp: date.
# When a fix lands, delete its lines.
#
# Owner of every entry below: Kartheek. Review by 2027-01-31.
# Source: release image scan, fork dry run 45168579211 (2026-11-23).

# --- Needs a major upgrade ---

# @fastify/middie 8.3.0 -> 9.3.2 (identity-service, credential-schema, credentials-service, oid4vc-service):
# major upgrade through the NestJS Fastify adapter; needs its own PR and a full test run
CVE-2026-6270 exp:2027-01-31
# spring-web 5.3.39 -> 6.0.0 (sunbird-rc-core, claim-ms, id-gen-service, encryption-service):
# affects HttpInvoker, which the repo does not use; fix needs Spring Boot 3 / Java 17
CVE-2016-1000027 exp:2027-01-31
# spring-webmvc 5.3.39 -> 7.0.9 (sunbird-rc-core, claim-ms, id-gen-service, encryption-service):
# no fix in 5.3.x; needs the Spring Boot 3 / Java 17 migration
CVE-2026-47884 exp:2027-01-31
# spring-security-web 5.7.13 / 5.8.16 -> 6.5.9 (sunbird-rc-core, claim-ms):
# needs the Spring Boot 3 / Java 17 migration
CVE-2026-22732 exp:2027-01-31
# io.netty:netty 3.9.9 / 3.10.6 -> 4.0.0 (sunbird-rc-core, claim-ms):
# transitive, not declared in any pom.xml; find which dependency pulls it in and exclude it
CVE-2019-20444 exp:2027-01-31
# org.neo4j:neo4j 3.2.3 -> 3.5.0 (sunbird-rc-core, claim-ms): transitive via neo4j-gremlin
# (java/registry/pom.xml); the CVE is in the Neo4j shell server, which is not configured (to confirm)
CVE-2021-34371 exp:2027-01-31
# jackson-databind 2.9.4 -> 2.9.10.4+ (sunbird-rc-core): shaded inside gremlin-shaded-3.3.3.jar,
